WEBVTT

00:02.730 --> 00:05.699
There exists a room of sorrow...

00:05.700 --> 00:10.369
The view from the
window can be seen clearly.

00:10.370 --> 00:13.930
Everyone besides me looks happy.

00:15.040 --> 00:20.949
It feels like I'm the only one who
hasn't moved in this ever-changing world.

00:20.950 --> 00:26.719
In this separated room, I waited
for the day I could go outside.

00:26.720 --> 00:28.789
But...

00:28.790 --> 00:31.759
that room has no doors.

00:31.760 --> 00:33.759
So, I wish...

00:33.760 --> 00:39.929
for the world outside the window
to stop, just like how it is in here.

00:39.930 --> 00:42.039
My only...

00:42.040 --> 00:43.300
wish...

01:01.720 --> 01:03.219
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

01:03.220 --> 01:07.229
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

01:07.230 --> 01:09.929
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

01:09.930 --> 01:12.799
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

01:12.800 --> 01:14.099
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

01:14.100 --> 01:18.309
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

01:18.310 --> 01:23.309
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

01:23.310 --> 01:27.749
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

01:27.750 --> 01:30.349
<i>you're there</i>

01:30.350 --> 01:33.189
<i>with a smile</i>

01:33.190 --> 01:38.689
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

01:38.690 --> 01:42.130
<i>And still</i>

01:43.800 --> 01:46.969
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

01:46.970 --> 01:51.269
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

01:51.270 --> 01:53.709
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

01:53.710 --> 01:55.379
<i>Now cross</i>

01:55.380 --> 01:58.049
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

01:58.050 --> 02:05.049
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

02:05.050 --> 02:11.550
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

02:13.800 --> 02:16.129
You surprised me.

02:16.130 --> 02:18.629
I didn't think you would come.

02:18.630 --> 02:21.339
You're the one who tipped us off.

02:21.340 --> 02:23.069
Well, yes...

02:23.070 --> 02:25.339
I did want to talk with
you about something.

02:25.340 --> 02:26.810
Talk?

02:27.810 --> 02:31.800
You hate me... right?

02:33.310 --> 02:34.419
Yuzuki...

02:34.420 --> 02:36.719
How far did you go...?

02:36.720 --> 02:39.689
How far?

02:39.690 --> 02:41.919
Just a kiss...

02:41.920 --> 02:42.890
K-Ki...?!

02:42.891 --> 02:45.159
I-It can't be helped!

02:45.160 --> 02:48.429
That was my wish, too...

02:48.430 --> 02:52.899
All Hanayo-<i>san</i> did was
make my wish come true.

02:52.900 --> 02:57.339
I-I mean I did want to, um...
kiss him sooner than later!

02:57.340 --> 02:58.830
Kiss...

03:01.580 --> 03:04.049
Wha...?! Wh-What is it, Hanayo-<i>san</i>?

03:04.050 --> 03:07.179
You haven't changed at
all even after being an LRIG.

03:07.180 --> 03:08.879
Straightforward and gullible...

03:08.880 --> 03:10.249
Wh-What?!

03:10.250 --> 03:13.759
easily hurt, yet desperately
trying to look strong.

03:13.760 --> 03:16.059
You really...

03:16.060 --> 03:18.250
are similar to Kazuki.

03:19.560 --> 03:24.229
I approached Kazuki to fulfill your wish.

03:24.230 --> 03:26.570
Kazuki is just like you.

03:28.440 --> 03:31.069
Isn't that...?
Eew...

03:31.070 --> 03:32.560
Gross...

03:37.110 --> 03:42.449
At first, all I wanted to
do was to fulfill your wish.

03:42.450 --> 03:44.549
But, I soon realized...

03:44.550 --> 03:47.159
that I was in love with Kazuki.

03:47.160 --> 03:48.090
Hanayo-<i>san...</i>

03:48.091 --> 03:51.389
That's why... I can't do this anymore.

03:51.390 --> 03:55.799
I love Kazuki, but I also like you, too!

03:55.800 --> 03:59.999
If finding happiness with
Kazuki becomes my wish...

04:00.000 --> 04:02.569
that would be a betrayal to you, Yuzuki!

04:02.570 --> 04:03.500
Hanayo-<i>san...</i>

04:03.501 --> 04:05.409
I don't want that!

04:05.410 --> 04:08.309
I can't betray you... deceive you!

04:08.310 --> 04:11.279
Kazuki thinks that I'm you!

04:11.280 --> 04:13.610
I can't continue doing
this to my precious...

04:18.350 --> 04:19.749
Kazuki?

04:19.750 --> 04:22.319
What was that about, Yuzuki...?

04:22.320 --> 04:24.660
What was that you were saying?!

04:27.300 --> 04:28.130
Um...

04:28.131 --> 04:29.290
No...!

04:31.500 --> 04:33.329
Yuzuki...?

04:33.330 --> 04:34.639
What's going on?

04:34.640 --> 04:36.269
Kazuki, wait!

04:36.270 --> 04:40.439
Kazuki, you're not a Selector,
so you can't hear Yuzuki's voice!

04:40.440 --> 04:41.809
H-Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

04:41.810 --> 04:45.109
Yuzuki's voice? Hanayo-<i>san</i>?

04:45.110 --> 04:48.149
Yuzuki... I'm sorry.

04:48.150 --> 04:52.319
I can't... fulfill your wish!

04:52.320 --> 04:54.019
Wait, Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

04:54.020 --> 04:56.619
Yuzuki!
Please wait!

04:56.620 --> 05:01.229
Please listen to our
story... Yuzuki's story!

05:01.230 --> 05:03.720
Yuzuki's story...?

05:10.310 --> 05:12.839
Why don't they understand?

05:12.840 --> 05:17.909
Even the ones I created
are leaving me behind...

05:17.910 --> 05:21.510
I'll be beside you...

05:27.860 --> 05:29.480
Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

05:34.260 --> 05:35.660
Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

05:36.930 --> 05:38.400
Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

05:39.430 --> 05:40.770
Ruko!

05:43.040 --> 05:44.940
Where's Hanayo-<i>san</i>?!

05:47.710 --> 05:49.439
Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

05:49.440 --> 05:51.449
Continue to fulfill my wish!

05:51.450 --> 05:55.119
I don't care if you betray
me, so live my wish!

05:55.120 --> 05:57.949
If not, you're going to die, Hanayo-<i>san</i>!

05:57.950 --> 06:00.080
Calm down, Yuzuki...

06:03.760 --> 06:05.589
It's okay...

06:05.590 --> 06:08.030
She'll be fine, Yuzuki...

06:15.140 --> 06:18.809
You're going to believe us?

06:18.810 --> 06:24.279
I can definitely feel Yuzuki's
presence from this card.

06:24.280 --> 06:28.449
An Eternal Girl that doesn't
fulfill their wish disappears.

06:28.450 --> 06:30.589
We need to save Hanayo-<i>san.</i>

06:30.590 --> 06:32.989
I need to hurry and become an LRIG...

06:32.990 --> 06:36.419
Ruko, you have one win.
If you can win a few more, then...

06:36.420 --> 06:37.989
There's not enough time!

06:37.990 --> 06:40.159
I'll battle once!

06:40.160 --> 06:43.159
You can battle again as long
as it isn't the same LRIG, right?

06:43.160 --> 06:45.429
All we have to do is split
up and find Selectors...

06:45.430 --> 06:46.969
It'll be too late!

06:46.970 --> 06:49.299
In that time, Hanayo-<i>san</i> will...!

06:49.300 --> 06:50.809
Maybe...

06:50.810 --> 06:52.839
you don't have to win multiple times.

06:52.840 --> 06:54.579
Huh?

06:54.580 --> 06:58.309
Ruko, you're just like how
I was when I was a Selector.

06:58.310 --> 07:02.819
You were already in a state
to have your wish granted.

07:02.820 --> 07:05.519
Tama didn't accept your wish, Ruko, so...

07:05.520 --> 07:07.319
an Eternal Girl wasn't born.

07:07.320 --> 07:08.290
That means...?!

07:08.291 --> 07:14.929
If Tama is willing to accept...
Ruko's wish can come true?!

07:14.930 --> 07:19.999
But, you can't go to the white window
room without being an LRIG, right?

07:20.000 --> 07:22.999
The battlefield is linked
to the white window room.

07:23.000 --> 07:23.970
Huh?!

07:23.971 --> 07:27.779
I'll try calling out for
Tama during battle.

07:27.780 --> 07:30.009
If my voice can reach Tama...

07:30.010 --> 07:33.310
then my wish can be granted.

07:43.990 --> 07:45.659
Yuzuki...

07:45.660 --> 07:47.659
Um, Hitoe?

07:47.660 --> 07:49.959
Can you ask Kazuki
something in place of me?

07:49.960 --> 07:50.999
Huh?

07:51.000 --> 07:53.669
Whether he loves me...

07:53.670 --> 07:57.839
or whether he loves
Hanayo-<i>san</i> in my form...

07:57.840 --> 07:58.640
Yuzuki...

07:58.641 --> 08:00.639
Ah! N-Never mind!

08:00.640 --> 08:02.379
I'll ask him myself...

08:02.380 --> 08:04.579
when I'm released from the card!

08:04.580 --> 08:05.709
Right, Ruko?

08:05.710 --> 08:06.910
Yup!

08:09.750 --> 08:10.910
Open!

08:21.530 --> 08:24.769
Is... this it?

08:24.770 --> 08:30.400
I can't... meet Ru anymore?

08:43.350 --> 08:46.749
Hitoe! Don't try to lose on purpose.

08:46.750 --> 08:50.629
Only serious battles will make Ru
shine, and light the way to Tama!

08:50.630 --> 08:52.359
Got it! Yuzuki!

08:52.360 --> 08:54.899
Of course! I'm not going to go easy!

08:54.900 --> 08:56.560
Fiery Ambition!

08:59.400 --> 09:00.469
Yuki!

09:00.470 --> 09:01.539
Who...?

09:01.540 --> 09:02.639
Huh?

09:02.640 --> 09:04.939
That voice...

09:04.940 --> 09:06.770
Tama?!

09:07.810 --> 09:11.479
Who is... Yuki?

09:11.480 --> 09:12.970
Tama...

09:16.220 --> 09:18.549
It's me... Kuro.

09:18.550 --> 09:22.719
But... I'm not Kuro anymore. I'm Yuki.

09:22.720 --> 09:25.989
Just like you, Ru gave me a name...

09:25.990 --> 09:27.090
Yuki!

09:37.240 --> 09:40.609
Tama... We were born from Mayu.

09:40.610 --> 09:41.779
Yup...

09:41.780 --> 09:45.079
But, the person who gave us our names...

09:45.080 --> 09:49.249
The person who taught us
of the outside world was Ru.

09:49.250 --> 09:51.089
Yup...

09:51.090 --> 09:54.089
So, let's show our gratitude...

09:54.090 --> 09:56.789
Together we'll grant Ru's wish!

09:56.790 --> 09:57.950
Yuki!

09:59.460 --> 10:04.029
We'll win this battle in the next turn!

10:04.030 --> 10:05.429
Yuzuki!

10:05.430 --> 10:06.630
Tama!

10:08.440 --> 10:09.870
Yuki...!

10:14.110 --> 10:16.370
I accept...

10:20.510 --> 10:21.710
Ruko!

10:32.490 --> 10:34.799
the laws of the Selector.

10:34.800 --> 10:36.890
Now...

10:40.900 --> 10:44.460
a new Eternal Girl will be born!

10:51.910 --> 10:53.380
Yuzuki!

10:59.150 --> 11:00.590
What...?

11:03.490 --> 11:04.930
That's...

11:20.410 --> 11:21.609
Hitoe-<i>san</i>!

11:21.610 --> 11:23.609
Is Yuzuki back, too?

11:23.610 --> 11:24.610
Ruko!

11:24.910 --> 11:26.209
Ruko!

11:26.210 --> 11:28.019
Was the wish... granted?

11:28.020 --> 11:30.249
B-But, something's not right...

11:30.250 --> 11:32.419
Yuki's card didn't change either...

11:32.420 --> 11:35.759
There has to be some sort of
change with the wish being granted.

11:35.760 --> 11:40.529
Um... I might be wrong,
but can I say something?

11:40.530 --> 11:44.269
Ruko-<i>san</i> did this battle so that she
could go to the white window room...

11:44.270 --> 11:46.429
to meet this girl, Mayu, right?

11:46.430 --> 11:48.539
Y-Yes...

11:48.540 --> 11:51.039
Is that the only place she's at?

11:51.040 --> 11:52.269
Huh?

11:52.270 --> 11:58.649
Mayu created a world of Selector battles so that
she can escape from her harsh realities, right?

11:58.650 --> 12:03.949
If so, maybe she's suffering
even now, in this real world, too...

12:03.950 --> 12:05.549
Th-That's right!

12:05.550 --> 12:10.589
Even if we don't go to the white window room,
if we can convince the real Mayu, then...!

12:10.590 --> 12:14.820
But if that's the case,
why didn't Yuki tell us that?

12:15.930 --> 12:17.969
What's the matter, Hitoe?

12:17.970 --> 12:22.969
That place we had a glimpse
of before exiting the battlefield...

12:22.970 --> 12:25.439
The white window room!

12:25.440 --> 12:31.240
If that's it, then I recall
seeing a place like that...

12:43.260 --> 12:44.489
You're...

12:44.490 --> 12:46.129
Mayu.

12:46.130 --> 12:48.629
You're so stupid...

12:48.630 --> 12:52.429
Shiro is playing hide-and-seek now.

12:52.430 --> 12:56.699
Even if Kuro and Shiro's
feelings are in sync...

12:56.700 --> 13:00.139
without Shiro, your
wish won't come true...

13:00.140 --> 13:03.379
Mayu, please listen to what we have to say!

13:03.380 --> 13:05.609
What did you just say?

13:05.610 --> 13:07.449
P-Please listen to...

13:07.450 --> 13:11.349
Kuro... Did you just say "we"?

13:11.350 --> 13:13.619
Kuro, you're supposed to be all alone.

13:13.620 --> 13:17.290
The word "we" isn't a word that fits Kuro.

13:20.160 --> 13:23.799
Her name isn't "Kuro!" It's "Yuki!"

13:23.800 --> 13:25.899
Yuki?

13:25.900 --> 13:27.539
Lame...

13:27.540 --> 13:32.639
Like, seasons don't mean anything
when you're trapped inside a card!

13:32.640 --> 13:34.139
What an idiot!

13:34.140 --> 13:36.009
She's just an LRIG!

13:36.010 --> 13:39.070
Yuki's feelings are Mayu's feelings...

13:40.150 --> 13:42.319
and Tama's too...

13:42.320 --> 13:44.819
Both of them were born from Mayu...

13:44.820 --> 13:49.159
Together, they form your true feelings...

13:49.160 --> 13:57.160
You sought protection with snow that won't
harm you, covering everything in silence.

13:57.600 --> 14:00.729
But, your other feeling...

14:00.730 --> 14:06.260
longed for the pleasant summer
sun that shone on all things.

14:07.780 --> 14:09.839
Yuzuki was saying...

14:09.840 --> 14:13.279
that it was lonely
being in the card alone.

14:13.280 --> 14:16.849
She couldn't get out
with walls parting her way.

14:16.850 --> 14:22.090
That must be the pain
you held all this time.

14:23.520 --> 14:28.529
You hated being the only one enclosed
in the room, so to everyone you...

14:28.530 --> 14:30.399
So you're saying that Mayu...

14:30.400 --> 14:33.090
is all alone, right?

14:34.240 --> 14:35.539
That's not it!

14:35.540 --> 14:38.969
Mayu isn't alone.

14:38.970 --> 14:41.779
Been a while since you've
seen me in this form, hasn't it?

14:41.780 --> 14:43.079
Urith!

14:43.080 --> 14:45.809
You wanted to become an
LRIG to a strong Selector.

14:45.810 --> 14:48.319
That's what you wished for, right?

14:48.320 --> 14:50.419
But not me...

14:50.420 --> 14:55.819
I wanted to be an LRIG to a Selector
that can bring greater despair to others.

14:55.820 --> 14:59.089
And, that wish came true...

14:59.090 --> 15:04.469
Mayu brought stories of endless
suffering to countless numbers of girls.

15:04.470 --> 15:07.130
She's my true Selector!

15:09.400 --> 15:11.839
Come on, let's battle!

15:11.840 --> 15:15.509
I've been wanting to slap
that dry, ignorant face of yours!

15:15.510 --> 15:17.439
Come now... Hurry!

15:17.440 --> 15:21.849
We didn't come here for battle!
We came here to talk!

15:21.850 --> 15:25.649
Please, Mayu! Stop all
these sad, heartless battles!

15:25.650 --> 15:28.119
There's a more fun way to battle!

15:28.120 --> 15:29.419
Fun?

15:29.420 --> 15:32.489
Ah... You're talking about that?

15:32.490 --> 15:37.129
The battle conducted at the library
courtyard with no wishes at stake...

15:37.130 --> 15:40.260
A battle so boring that it made me yawn...

15:41.270 --> 15:43.099
I know all about that.

15:43.100 --> 15:44.839
Okay...

15:44.840 --> 15:47.770
Let's do it there, then.

16:03.790 --> 16:05.559
Now, let's begin.

16:05.560 --> 16:08.799
Show me how "fun" battles are, Ruko.

16:08.800 --> 16:10.199
Why?!

16:10.200 --> 16:13.799
Battling Mayu won't change anything...

16:13.800 --> 16:16.239
It's not like my wish would come true...

16:16.240 --> 16:18.539
There could be meaning
in doing this battle.

16:18.540 --> 16:20.069
Huh?

16:20.070 --> 16:22.639
Mayu used to play
WIXOSS all the time, but...

16:22.640 --> 16:25.879
she's never battled someone else before.

16:25.880 --> 16:30.149
Being alone, she always battled
imaginary opponents she created.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.889
Ru.

16:31.890 --> 16:34.859
I was able to change
through the battles with you.

16:34.860 --> 16:36.259
Yuki...

16:36.260 --> 16:41.920
Your battles held brilliance
that can move people's hearts.

16:43.760 --> 16:45.899
What are you babbling about?

16:45.900 --> 16:47.939
Mayu is going to go first.

16:47.940 --> 16:49.930
Urith. Grow.

17:02.780 --> 17:05.249
She's strong, but...!

17:05.250 --> 17:08.689
It looks like what you said was true, Yuki.

17:08.690 --> 17:13.759
If we don't move to her predictions,
she gets agitated and loses control.

17:13.760 --> 17:15.629
Turn end!

17:15.630 --> 17:17.429
Wh-What?

17:17.430 --> 17:19.799
Mayu! Hurry with the next order!

17:19.800 --> 17:22.369
What...? Why...?

17:22.370 --> 17:24.769
Why isn't she attacking?

17:24.770 --> 17:27.109
If Kuro attacked...

17:27.110 --> 17:31.879
I would gain enough Ener to
unleash Arts on Mayu's next turn...

17:31.880 --> 17:33.710
Why...?
Mayu!

17:35.380 --> 17:37.989
But... Mayu won't lose.

17:37.990 --> 17:40.949
Because, it's about time...

17:40.950 --> 17:43.450
Attack Ahriman with Brionac!

17:48.130 --> 17:51.269
That didn't work one bit.

17:51.270 --> 17:55.169
Kuro? Did you forget the
rules of Selector battles?

17:55.170 --> 17:56.799
What?

17:56.800 --> 17:58.500
Look at yourself.

18:03.440 --> 18:07.609
There was someone else to be
worried about besides Hanayo.

18:07.610 --> 18:10.849
With Urazoe Iona back in her body...

18:10.850 --> 18:12.349
Yuki...

18:12.350 --> 18:15.159
you're disqualified
from being an Eternal Girl.

18:15.160 --> 18:17.489
Y-Yuki!

18:17.490 --> 18:18.989
Fine...

18:18.990 --> 18:21.459
Sooner or later, this was to happen.

18:21.460 --> 18:22.759
Huh?!

18:22.760 --> 18:26.629
I'm a being that's never existed.

18:26.630 --> 18:30.630
I'm a character from a
story that Mayu made.

18:31.670 --> 18:34.139
I'm Yuki...

18:34.140 --> 18:35.939
I'll disappear like the melting snow.

18:35.940 --> 18:36.840
No!

18:36.841 --> 18:39.679
Absolutely not, Yuki!

18:39.680 --> 18:41.150
Ru...

18:42.320 --> 18:43.719
Tama!

18:43.720 --> 18:46.789
Tama can't come out of here...

18:46.790 --> 18:50.289
Bring Tama to where Yuki is...

18:50.290 --> 18:52.129
Please...

18:52.130 --> 18:53.390
Tama...

18:54.390 --> 18:57.800
What's holding you up?!
Hurry up and continue the battle!

19:00.070 --> 19:02.499
Ruko! What are you doing?!

19:02.500 --> 19:06.070
You can't quit in the middle of battle!

19:14.250 --> 19:16.319
This way!

19:16.320 --> 19:17.479
The library?

19:17.480 --> 19:19.180
This courtyard...

19:20.190 --> 19:21.710
It's right up ahead!

19:31.230 --> 19:33.599
Another structure?

19:33.600 --> 19:38.109
This library looks old, but it's still new.

19:38.110 --> 19:41.679
I heard it was remodeled
from someone's mansion.

19:41.680 --> 19:43.840
I feel like I've seen that before...

19:44.910 --> 19:46.779
Yup.

19:46.780 --> 19:49.619
It feels similar, doesn't it?

19:49.620 --> 19:51.549
So then, Mayu's there?!

19:51.550 --> 19:53.289
I don't know, but...

19:53.290 --> 19:54.590
Let's go!

19:59.360 --> 20:01.029
Yuki! Stay with me!

20:01.030 --> 20:04.430
I'll take you to where Tama is right away!

20:09.140 --> 20:10.599
Why...?

20:10.600 --> 20:14.139
That yard was exactly like
how it was at the library, but...

20:14.140 --> 20:17.409
this place is so vague and abstract...

20:17.410 --> 20:19.209
I think... I understand now...

20:19.210 --> 20:19.950
Huh?

20:19.951 --> 20:26.089
Mayu kept Tama sealed away, not allowing
her to participate in Selector battles.

20:26.090 --> 20:29.619
It bothered me as to why Tama awakened.

20:29.620 --> 20:33.489
But... I think I understand now...

20:33.490 --> 20:35.329
Yuki?!

20:35.330 --> 20:36.630
Mayu...

20:38.730 --> 20:40.430
"No Trespassing"

20:45.340 --> 20:48.109
No one's living here?

20:48.110 --> 20:51.609
What are you kids doing here?

20:51.610 --> 20:56.119
Um... We're friends with
the girl who lives here.

20:56.120 --> 20:59.449
Hm? The girl here...

20:59.450 --> 21:01.019
Mayu...

21:01.020 --> 21:04.359
probably died already...

21:04.360 --> 21:06.590
That's right, Kuro.

21:09.430 --> 21:11.929
Mayu is a dead girl now.

21:11.930 --> 21:14.129
M-Mayu!

21:14.130 --> 21:19.669
Kuro won't... leave Mayu
in true solitude, right?

21:19.670 --> 21:23.539
You'll disappear with Mayu, right?

21:23.540 --> 21:26.270
Grow, Urith. Level 5.

21:39.460 --> 21:40.829
Yuki...?

21:40.830 --> 21:42.690
Yuki...!

21:43.800 --> 21:44.899
Yuki!

21:44.900 --> 21:46.969
No... Say something...

21:46.970 --> 21:48.139
Yuki...

21:48.140 --> 21:49.999
N-No...

21:50.000 --> 21:52.469
Nooo...!

21:52.470 --> 21:55.900
"That Locked Window"

22:02.320 --> 22:03.749
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.750 --> 22:09.189
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:09.190 --> 22:13.729
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:13.730 --> 22:15.329
<i>I do...</i>

22:15.330 --> 22:20.929
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:20.930 --> 22:25.609
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:25.610 --> 22:31.109
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:31.110 --> 22:37.279
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:37.280 --> 22:42.389
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:42.390 --> 22:50.390
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:54.100 --> 22:59.209
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:59.210 --> 23:05.909
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:05.910 --> 23:10.949
<i>Release myself towards
the future I selected</i>

23:10.950 --> 23:13.589
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.590 --> 23:20.650
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:38.610 --> 23:40.940
"This Selection..."

23:39.110 --> 23:40.780
This Selection...
